| `src/views/MessengerView.vue` | Modify | Template | Updated MessengerChannelList to use `:groups="channels"` instead of `:groups="groupChats"` |
| `src/views/MessengerView.vue` | Modify | Method | Removed `loadGroupChats()` method - no longer needed as channels are now reactive via store getter |
| `src/views/MessengerView.vue` | Modify | Hook | Removed call to `loadGroupChats()` from `created()` |
