## Summary of Changes

✅ **All 3 files updated successfully with the following benefits:**

1. **Real-time Channel Updates**: Channels now automatically update when messages arrive via the `channels` getter that tracks `lastMessageAt`
2. **Dynamic Chat Modes**: ChatModeSelector now reads all modes from store, making it easy to add/remove modes globally
3. **New "channel" Mode**: Added to CHAT_MODES configuration for use throughout the app
4. **Automatic Sorting**: Channels in the messenger are always sorted by most recent message
5. **Removed Code Duplication**: No longer need to manually manage group chats array - store handles this reactively

The implementation leverages Vue's reactivity system - any chat update that changes `lastMessageAt` will automatically re-sort the channels list and update the UI in real-time.

